Testing tips
• Postman (or any WS client) works fine for a first pass — connect, send the auth
message, then watch for INCOMING_CALL on a test call.
• If you're not seeing audio frames at all, check you're actually reading the message
type (BINARY vs TEXT) before parsing — this is the single most common early
integration issue we see.
• Happy to jump on a call for your first live test run if useful.
For anything not covered here, reach out — this doc will keep growing as we onboard more
bots.